## Title: Error Catcher
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 100
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: The author's personal debugging tool, published only so it can be installed on a console. It writes to LibConsoleLogger: each Lua error with its whole call chain, every dialog shown and who asked for it, which add-on wraps which game function, and the moment a button is built that the game does not trust.
## SavedVariables: ErrorCatcherSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibConsoleLogger
## DevId: e5653713-b8c8-4408-9f6b-3ca2cad33006

